# A leading '/' in a nested .gitignore anchors to THIS directory, not the repo
# root, so the binary `go build` drops next to these sources is '/contexteval'.
# The previous '/scripts/contexteval/contexteval' resolved to
# scripts/contexteval/scripts/contexteval/contexteval, matched nothing, and left
# a 35 MB Mach-O tracked from #1125 onward without anyone noticing.
/contexteval
